            "name": "Amazon Managed Service for Apache Flink Add Application Vpc Configuration",
            "description": {
              "content": "<p>Adds a Virtual Private Cloud (VPC) configuration to the application. Applications can use VPCs to store and access resources securely.</p> <p>Note the following about VPC configurations for Kinesis Data Analytics applications:</p> <ul> <li> <p>VPC configurations are not supported for SQL applications.</p> </li> <li> <p>When a VPC is added to a Kinesis Data Analytics application, the application can no longer be accessed from the Internet directly. To enable Internet access to the application, add an Internet gateway to your VPC.</p> </li> </ul>",
              "type": "text/plain"
            },
            "url": {
              "path": [
                ""
              ],
              "hash": "X-Amz-Target=KinesisAnalytics_20180523.AddApplicationVpcConfiguration",
